title: Exfiltration via Telegram Bot API
id: 474fb281-d64e-4fb5-b06a-1cffc4a863e3
status: experimental
description: Detects use of the Telegram Bot API (api.telegram.org sendDocument/sendMessage) by scripting user agents, a channel widely used by infostealers to exfiltrate collected data to an attacker-controlled bot.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/
logsource:
  category: proxy
detection:
  selection:
    cs-host|contains: 'api.telegram.org'
    cs-uri-stem|contains:
      - '/sendDocument'
      - '/sendMessage'
      - '/bot'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-host
  - cs-user-agent
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate Telegram integrations
level: high
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1567
